  "body": "Designed to enrich everyday living, this beautifully appointed single-level home brings together contemporary style, generous proportions, and practical family functionality. Set on an approximately 392sqm section with an approximately 187.67sqm floor area, every space has been carefully planned to create a home that is as comfortable as it is visually impressive. Complete with a 10-Year Master Build Guarantee, it offers lasting confidence for years to come.\r\n\r\nStep inside to discover a welcoming interior where a light-filled open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area create an effortless sense of space. The designer kitchen embraces a sophisticated dark colour palette, creating a refined and contemporary focal point. Complemented by a generous island bench, quality appliances, and ample storage throughout, it delivers a perfect balance of striking aesthetics and everyday functionality. Overlooking the dining and family living area, it encourages connection while providing an ideal setting for both casual meals and entertaining.\r\n\r\nAdding further versatility is an additional lounge, offering valuable extra living space for movie nights, children's activities, or simply a quiet retreat away from the main hub of the home. Large sliding doors open onto an expansive deck, where the indoor and outdoor spaces blend naturally. \r\n\r\nThe privately positioned master bedroom provides a peaceful escape, complete with a walk-in wardrobe and a stylish ensuite finished with quality fittings. Three additional well-proportioned bedrooms are complemented by two stylish family bathrooms, one of which includes a bathtub. Thoughtfully designed for flexibility and comfort, the layout is perfectly suited to growing families, professionals, or those seeking extra space for guests.\r\n\r\nAdditional features include:\r\n-Central air-conditioning\r\n-Intercom system\r\n-Underfloor heating in bathrooms\r\n-Double internal-access garage with laundry nook\r\n\r\nLocated in a peaceful, family-friendly neighbourhood, the home is conveniently close to local schools, parks, shops, and public transport. Cafés, supermarkets, and scenic walking tracks are all within easy reach. The Northern Motorway connection provides a smooth commute to the city or North Shore, while Orewa's stunning golden beach is just minutes away, offering the ultimate coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nBlending timeless design with everyday practicality, this outstanding residence delivers the flexibility, comfort, and quality today's families are looking for. \r\n\r\nContact Team Sabrina today to arrange your private viewing and experience everything this exceptional home has to offer.",
